{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Bypass ambient proxies for every loopback hop**\n\n`urlopen` honors `HTTP_PROXY`/`ALL_PROXY`, and `harness_env()` also preserves them. Without an appropriate `NO_PROXY`, local requests can be sent to the ambient proxy, breaking the run and exposing signed invocation payloads. Use an explicit no-proxy opener and sanitize or override proxy variables in child environments; add a sentinel-proxy regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75QHIW","finding_digest":"7d714a5065941e1d09f6a3ac5f92121355a23544714ccfd22de784f2581d9d44","finding_id":"arf_v1_pvyuuudfsqpb2cpwuowf7eqscn","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::proxyhandler-call::loopback-proxy-bypass","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::proxyhandler-call::loopback-proxy-bypass","line":209,"observation_digest":"2f798f34f8f6f445f8ab0138c408d7730b2d8ee539c87765a8321b2150c5427e","observation_id":"aro_v1_f54y6nhy632el6flae4micgxom","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pvyuuudfsqpb2cpwuowf7eqscn","published_at":"2026-10-05T07:49:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lsjtv47drrinlxltegbpdkzd5v","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"64135ddf7c7a779190dcc96159d210359736d153","reviewer":"codex","start_line":209,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_7cz5a6ocfj3daedts2plf63d2i","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T07:49:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
